uct/Impero-Freestanding-Bath_imp007-mw","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-imp007-mw","label":"Matte White"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div>Immerse yourself in the classic aesthetics of a bygone era with our Impero Collection. The Impero Bath pays meticulous attention to detail and subtle nods to the classic bathroom era. The Impero bath serves as the perfect centrepiece for any Federation bathroom, where traditional styling seamlessly merges with modern comfort and technology. Crafted from stone composite solid surface, Impero not only boasts timeless beauty but also offers a touch of modernity. Its tactile matte white finish exudes elegance, and it quickly warms to the touch while efficiently retaining heat. Complete the Federation style experience with the Impero Collection, a complete range of traditional bathware from Studio Bagno, where the grace of tradition meets the convenience of the contemporary.<div><div><b>Made with MarmoTech</b></div><div>Constructed from a formulation of premium stone composite materials and 100% silica free, each bath undergoes a meticulous process, ensuring the highest standards of quality and durability. The result is a freestanding bath with a luxurious tactile finish, that not only feels exquisite but also warms quickly and helps maintains water temperature.</div></div><div>Notes:</div><div>-Non - Overflow &amp; waste included<br/></div><div>-Plug &amp; Waste included as standard with bath: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw009-mw\"><b>SBW009/MW</b></a><br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
